msgid "Preferences apply across projects. Local alerts work even when the chat panel is closed.\n\nClear success/error selections to use the editor's default sounds. Taskbar attention depends on your operating system.\n\nChoose a permission sound to enable playback. Repeated requests are limited to one sound every two seconds; resolved requests never play late. Preview ignores notification toggles."
